{
  "type": "html",
  "title": "连续分配存储管理方式演示",
  "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>连续分配存储管理</title>\n<style>\nbody{margin:0;font-family:Arial}.container{display:flex;height:100vh}\n#canvas{background:#f5f5f5}.panel{width:300px;padding:20px;border-right:1px solid #ccc}\nh2{color:#333}button{margin:5px 0;padding:8px;cursor:pointer}\nselect{width:100%;padding:5px}.info{margin-top:20px;font-size:14px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<canvas id=\"canvas\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\"></canvas>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2>连续分配方式</h2>\n<button onclick=\"setMode('single')\">单一连续分配</button>\n<button onclick=\"setMode('fixed')\">固定分区分配</button>\n<button onclick=\"setMode('dynamic')\">动态分区分配</button>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:20px\">动态分区算法</h3>\n<select id=\"algoSelect\" onchange=\"updateAlgo()\">\n<option value=\"ff\">首次适应(FF)</option>\n<option value=\"nf\">循环首次适应(NF)</option>\n<option value=\"bf\">最佳适应(BF)</option>\n<option value=\"wf\">最坏适应(WF)</option>\n</select>\n<div class=\"info\">\n<p>当前模式: <span id=\"currentMode\">单一连续</span></p>\n<p>当前算法: <span id=\"currentAlgo\">首次适应(FF)</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst canvas=document.getElementById('canvas');\nconst ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\nlet mode='single', algo='ff';\nfunction draw(){\nctx.clearRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);\nif(mode==='single'){\ndrawSingle();}\nelse if(mode==='fixed'){\ndrawFixed();}\nelse {\ndrawDynamic();}\nrequestAnimationFrame(draw);\n}\nfunction drawSingle(){//单一连续分配\nctx.fillStyle='#ddd';\nctx.fillRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);\nctx.strokeStyle='black';\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(canvas.width/2,0);\nctx.lineTo(canvas.width/2,canvas.height);\nctx.stroke();\nctx.fillStyle='blue';\nctx.fillRect(0,0,canvas.width/2-10,canvas.height);\nctx.fillStyle='red';\nctx.fillRect(canvas.width/2+10,0,canvas.width/2-10,canvas.height);\nctx.fillStyle='black';\nctx.font='16px Arial';\nctx.fillText('系统区',20,30);\nctx.fillText('用户区',canvas.width/2+30,30);\n}\nfunction drawFixed(){//固定分区分配\nctx.fillStyle='#eee';\nctx.fillRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);\nconst w=canvas.width/4;\nfor(let i=0;i<4;i++){\nctx.fillStyle=['#aaa','#bbb','#ccc','#ddd'][i];\nctx.fillRect(i*w,0,w,canvas.height);\nctx.strokeStyle='black';\nctx.strokeRect(i*w,0,w,canvas.height);\nctx.fillStyle='black';\nctx.font='14px Arial';\nctx.fillText(`分区${i}`,i*w+w/2-10,20);\n}\n}\nfunction drawDynamic(){//动态分区分配\nctx.fillStyle='#fafafa';\nctx.fillRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);\nconst blocks=[{x:50,w:100},{x:200,w:150},{x:400,w:120}];\nblocks.forEach((b,i)=>{\\nctx.fillStyle=['#aaf','#baf','#caf'][i];\\nctx.fillRect(b.x,100,b.w,150);\\nctx.strokeStyle='black';\\nctx.strokeRect(b.x,100,b.w,150);\\nctx.fillStyle='black';\\nctx.font='14px Arial';\\nctx.fillText(`空闲块${i}`,b.x+b.w/2-20,90);\n});\nctx.fillStyle='black';\nctx.font='16px Arial';\nctx.fillText('空闲链表示例',canvas.width/2-50,70);\n}\nfunction setMode(m){mode=m;document.getElementById('currentMode').textContent=m==='single'?'单一连续':m==='fixed'?'固定分区':'动态分区';draw();}\nfunction updateAlgo(){algo=document.getElementById('algoSelect').value;document.getElementById('currentAlgo').textContent=['首次适应(FF)','循环首次适应(NF)','最佳适应(BF)','最坏适应(WF)'][['ff','nf','bf','wf'].indexOf(algo)];draw();}\nwindow.onload=()=>{draw();};\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "description": "本动画演示三种连续分配方式及四种动态分区算法。左侧面板可选择分配类型，右侧Canvas实时渲染内存布局。单一连续分配显示系统/用户区划分；固定分区展示等大分区；动态分区呈现多块空闲内存及其链表结构。可通过下拉菜单切换不同算法策略。",
  "knowledge_base_quote": [
    "源于教材知识库：《操作系统原理》第三章 存储管理：连续分配方式为用户程序分配连续的内存空间，包括单一连续分配、固定分区分配和动态分区分配。",
    "具体引用的原句：",
    "连续分配是指为作业分配一块连续的内存空间。"
  ],
  "subtype": "animation"
}